<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Yulon January/Sept profit surges.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Yulon January/Sept profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				27,550   vs    24,500</p>
<p>    net-tax profit			 1,010   vs	  89</p>
<p>NOTE - Yulon Motor Co Ltd is one of Taiwan's biggest car makers. A company spokesman said the introduction of its new Cefiro model helped boost the company's profit.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
